pkgs/windows is copied from nova-nix (https://github.com/Novavero-AI/nova-nix)
at commit 686c4ca895358b744264bd1cbd14780db4c1d2bc, pkgs/windows: the stage-1
stdenv (stdenv/, bootstrap/), lib.nix, fetchurl.nix, mirrors.nix, sources.nix,
hello.nix and by-name/he/hello. The stdenv files are unchanged, so the
derivations goonix writes are the ones nova-nix writes, and outputs in
nova-nix's binary cache (https://cache.novavero.ai) can be substituted.
default.nix is changed to leave out the seed stdenv, which this copy does not
carry.

